{"images":["data:image/webp;base64,"],"messages":[{"content":"Thuy Dau, Ngoc Bui, Sam Su, and Lan Voung conducted a survey as to how long customers at Lucky claimed to wait in the checkout line until their turn. Let X = time in line. Table 6.1 displays the ordered real data (in minutes): <image> Determine the cumulative relative frequency for waiting less than 6.1 minutes.\n\n(A) 0.62\n(B) 0.63\n(C) 0.64\n(D) 0.65\n\nAnswer with the option's letter from the given choices directly.","role":"user"}]}